set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A264617

Irregular triangle read by rows: T(n,k) = number of signed unichromosonal genomes with n genes at 4-break distance k from a fixed genome, 0 <= k <= floor((n+1)/3).

The 43 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A264617

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
